### Create MariaDB musician profile (PDA stays null until confirm/recover)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/musicians
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "instrumentId": 1,
  "countryCode": "MEX"
}

### Confirm DevNet upsert_musician_profile (replace signature + PDA after wallet TX)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/musicians/{{profileId}}/profile/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "{{walletPubkey}}",
  "txSignature": "{{txSignature}}",
  "musicianProfilePda": "{{musicianProfilePda}}"
}

### Recover PDA already on DevNet when MariaDB is still null (no new signature)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/musicians/{{profileId}}/profile/recover
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "{{walletPubkey}}"
}

### Confirm without Bearer is 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/musicians/1/profile/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sSessionTest11111111111111111111111111111",
  "txSignature": "sig",
  "musicianProfilePda": "pda"
}
